Exactly what are you typing in and what results are you seeing?  Can you
verify that you have a good copy of VMS on the disk and VMB on the
floppy?  Does the VMB version match the VMS version?  You can generally
mix nearest major versions like VMS 4.x with VMB for VMS 3.x, but you 
