using the Q-bus machines, a search engine can find lots of stuff.

You might also search the http://www.deja.com usenet for "q-bus","hoffman",
and "serpentine".

Check also the "Ask The Wizard" link from http://www.openvms.compaq.com/

> I have been cruising for FAQ's and webpages of interest, but any
> you think appropriate are most highly appreciated.

You should find a lot, but the best is to see if you can find a manual that
I think is called "Microsystem Options".  As I do not have one handy here, I
can not verify the title.

You also may find more q-bus people hanging out on comp.os.vms than here.

