  I've not tried it, but the book suggests the following
procedure. Assuming you have a 2 member mirrorset called M1
and a spare disk called DISK310 you want to make the
snapshot onto :

HSZ20> SET M1 NOPOLICY    ! Disable automatic member replacement
HSZ20> SET M1 MEMBERSHIP=3   ! Increase size of mirrorset to 3 devices
HSZ20> SET M1 REPLACE=DISK310   ! Add spare device into mirrorset

  ... wait for M1 to normalize ...

HSZ20> SHOW M1             ! Make sure all disks "normal"
HSZ20> REDUCE DISK310     ! Remove DISK310 from mirrorset
HSZ20> ADD MIRRORSET C_M1 DISK310   ! Make a clone mirrorset from DISK310
HSZ20> INITIALIZE C_M1 NODESTROY CHUNK=128  ! Initialize mirrorset ( NODESTROY is critical here )
HSZ20> ADD UNIT D C_M1  ! Create a unit for the clone mirrorset

  disclaimer: haven't tried it, watch out for typos, etc

